# Proxy /thisbigbaby to the Z-soundboard Netlify site.
# MUST stay above the /* SPA fallback — rules are evaluated top-to-bottom.
# The /thisbigbaby/* proxy MUST come before the bare /thisbigbaby redirect:
# Netlify normalizes trailing slashes, so a bare /thisbigbaby rule placed first
# would also match /thisbigbaby/ and redirect it to itself (infinite loop).
/thisbigbaby/*          https://z-sounds.netlify.app/:splat    200!
/thisbigbaby            /thisbigbaby/                          301!

# SPA fallback for Vue Router
# Existing files (like /chase-travel/index.html) will be served first
/*    /index.html   200
